      "writtenOn": "2020-09-21T21:53:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have a few threads interacting here: UceController+Controller thread, main thread, and ImsService binder thread.\n\nAre you expecting it to be the UceController\u0027s responsibility to move the requests from main/ImsService thread onto the UceController thread or each of the individual controllers\u0027 responsibilities?\n\nMy first thought is that it may be easier for UceController to handle thread management so that the Controllers can assume everything is on a singular thread.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 354,
        "startChar": 75,
        "endLine": 354,
        "endChar": 85
      },
      "revId": "482c8b9540e960d693f411d533ca84757ff1f195",
