      "writtenOn": "2020-09-22T04:23:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My original thought is that this request is simple and it could be handled in the UceController.  However, this request should be handled by OptionsController more suitable.\n\nSince the looper of handler thread is passed to each controllers, all controllers share one message queue. The UceController is only responsible for crating and destroying the looper.",
